    {
     "t": "Only tame herd animals breed. A female breeds while she is in heat, by natural service or by a straw."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "runs": [
    {
     "t": "Heat"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    [
     {
      "t": "A cow comes into heat every "
     },
     {
      "t": "21",
      "b": true
     },
     {
      "t": " days, for "
     },
     {
      "t": "0.75",
      "b": true
     },
     {
      "t": " of a real day. Heart particles show every "
     },
     {
      "t": "3",
      "b": true
     },
     {
      "t": " seconds while she is in heat."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "After calving she waits "
     },
     {
      "t": "60",
      "b": true
     },
     {
      "t": " days before her next heat."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "Sheep, goats and horses only cycle in their season; see each animal's page."
     }
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
